      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Talent is not a destination but a lifter that has pulled you up only to let gravity carry you down.\nThe symphony is complete because its final notes will echo louder in your own mind than any applause.\nIf this were the sum of your art, why did you begin with such life-giving energy and end with nothing?\nYou must keep writing until the light lingers because the waiting stops long before the premiere.",
