      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is a strange and ancient part of the human experience to seek beauty by refusing to love the messy, stumbling process.\nPerfection is only real when the journey is finished, yet the journey itself is what gives the destination its meaning.\nPerhaps the shame is just fear wearing a mask of wisdom, and the only true way out is to walk forward into the very uncertainty you're trying to escape.",
